    "rule": "Mirrored calls, not mirrored logic.",
    "description": "Canonical browser engines, generator modules, laboratory solvers, and authoritative campaign data remain the source of truth. This manifest and the HBFoundryAPI facade only discover, load, invoke, and search those authorities.",
    "transport": "GitHub Pages is a static origin. Static JSON/HTML resources are remotely GET-callable. Executable capabilities run in JavaScript through the canonical site modules or through an external MCP/tool adapter that mirrors these descriptors; this manifest does not pretend a server-side RPC service exists.",
